# Pinned cloudflared release for the kiosk image.
#
# The build refuses to ship an unverified binary, so both values below must be
# filled in before an ISO can be produced. To pin a release:
#
#   VERSION=2024.12.2
#   curl -fsSLO "https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared/releases/download/${VERSION}/cloudflared-linux-amd64"
#   sha256sum cloudflared-linux-amd64
#
# Paste the version and the resulting hash here, commit them, and
# config/hooks/live/01-lockdown.hook.chroot will verify every build against them.
#
# Leave SHA256 empty to build an image without the Cloudflare Tunnel binary:
# the tunnel service is already gated on /etc/cloudflared/config.yml existing,
# so the image still boots, it simply has no remote-access tunnel.

VERSION=
SHA256=
